text = "Philosphical zombies are theoretical creatures which are exactly like humans but which lack an internal, concious experience.

They are also coming after you and they're pissed.

Fight off the zombie hoard by answering ethical thought experiments. 

To shoot to your left, answer as a deonotolgist (act according to your duties)
To shoot to your right, answer as a consequentialist (maximize happiness for the greatest number of people)
To shoot high, answer as a libertarian (prioritize free will)
To shoot low, answer as a paternalist (restrict freedom, make decisions for others)"
